# Storage limits

Authoritative constants in `@repo/shared` (`SpaceConfig`):

- `ByteSize.STORAGE_RESERVE` — 5 GiB must remain free
- `SpaceConfig.FILE_MAX_BYTES` — 25 MiB
- `SpaceConfig.MAX_BYTES` — 250 MiB
- `SpaceConfig.MAX_FILES` — 50
- `SpaceConfig.ACCEPTED_MIME_TYPES` — jpeg + png (v1)

Enforce on FE dropzone, GraphQL add-files, and tus `onUploadCreate`.
